    show n_cg2_exp1 at cgfade
    n "Hey, [player]..."
    n "I-I don't think I can bend down without falling...!"
    n "Hurry and take this one..."
    mc "诶？"
    mc "But then I have to let go of the chair..."
    n "That's fine...!"
    n "Just for a second!"
    n "Hurry up..."
    mc "好吧......！"
    mc "你等我站起来先。"
    "我慢慢地松开椅子。"
    n "‘站起来’是什么意思啊？"
    "夏树低头看向我。"
    n "为什么你要蹲——"
